            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "Thanks for the suggestion!\n\nAlthough valid, I believe this use case is probably not particularly prevalent. You can preserve the original `vim.notify` [as described in the documentation](https://github.com/nvim-mini/mini.nvim/blob/6bf9eccaf2a5395b254bc031f9812cf163ca4187/doc/mini-notify.txt#L262-L267) (albeit, maybe its place could have been better, but this should also work).",
